  "description": "Expand your horizons with the new Solace Gravel. From all day Alpine epics to Saturday morning time-crunched escapes the Solace Gravel is hugely versatile. Quiet, efficient and with an almost zero drag crank mounted motor, the Solace features a 360Wh internal battery with optional 160Wh externally mounted range extender (included) to push the horizon that little bit further. 3 levels of assistance allow for battery optimization or full boost. Electronic shifting from SRAM's Force Xplr eTAP combined with our internal cable routing results in a clean cockpit, perfect for mounting handlebar and frame bags for when adventure truly calls.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
